Multi-Sheet Excel Merger Studio (v2.5 Enterprise Edition)

Architecture:
  - Engine Standard: pandas + openpyxl (high-throughput data aggregation, CSV mapping, row split).
  - Engine Human: win32com (Excel COM automation, exact Ctrl+A -> Ctrl+C -> Ctrl+V emulation,
